WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 28=

01:52.160 --> 01:53.320
Li Dian!

01:54.720 --> 01:55.320
Li Dian.

01:55.960 --> 01:56.640
No.

01:57.480 --> 01:59.040
Mr. Li, congratulations.

01:59.200 --> 02:00.400
You're the top scholar.

02:03.400 --> 02:04.440
I'm the top scholar?

02:09.759 --> 02:12.000
Why is Your Majesty so happy today?

02:12.120 --> 02:13.040
Let me tell you.

02:14.040 --> 02:14.960
I just received

02:15.520 --> 02:17.600
this year's top scorer, Li Dian.

02:18.160 --> 02:21.440
This man is truly full of knowledge.

02:22.040 --> 02:22.640
Moreover,

02:22.840 --> 02:25.560
his insights on politics
are sharp and deep.

02:26.120 --> 02:26.920
This time,

02:27.320 --> 02:28.840
Wuxia really made the right choice.

02:29.880 --> 02:31.480
He truly found a man of talent.

02:33.000 --> 02:33.640
In the past,

02:34.120 --> 02:35.600
I always thought this child

02:36.120 --> 02:37.120
was too honest

02:39.000 --> 02:41.320
and lacked tact
in handling people and matters.

02:41.720 --> 02:43.080
Seems like I was arbitrary.

02:44.640 --> 02:46.920
You're harsh
because you care deeply about him.

02:47.160 --> 02:49.200
Genuine fatherly love
isn't considered arbitrary.

02:50.720 --> 02:51.600
Fatherly love?

02:52.080 --> 02:52.680
Well said.

02:57.680 --> 02:58.280
However,

02:59.880 --> 03:01.520
I still think

03:01.960 --> 03:03.880
he lacks decisiveness.

03:04.960 --> 03:06.400
I fear he can't keep them in line.

03:09.840 --> 03:11.080
You need not worry.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.840
Let Wuxia gain some real experience.

03:14.320 --> 03:16.480
He will surely have great potential.

03:19.480 --> 03:20.080
Yes.

03:20.800 --> 03:22.440
He really must gain more experience.

03:23.760 --> 03:26.040
(Shunjing Residence)

03:26.120 --> 03:26.720
Your Highness.

03:27.080 --> 03:28.040
No need to dwell on it.

03:28.960 --> 03:31.080
Since His Majesty agreed
to Prince Wuxia's exam,

03:31.520 --> 03:32.520
he had to give face.

03:32.800 --> 03:34.520
That's why
he made Li Dian the top scorer.

03:36.960 --> 03:38.120
Why do you think

03:39.000 --> 03:40.960
Li Dian would bother me?

03:41.960 --> 03:44.600
You're worried
Prince Wuxia might gain favor

03:44.920 --> 03:46.040
for recommending him.

03:49.560 --> 03:50.680
I couldn't care less

03:51.120 --> 03:52.400
what they do.

03:53.560 --> 03:54.440
Check again

03:55.400 --> 03:56.920
if Hua has replied.

03:58.120 --> 03:58.760
Your Highness.

03:59.200 --> 04:00.120
Since you quit the exam

04:00.200 --> 04:01.960
and sent the letter to Her Highness,

04:02.040 --> 04:03.280
I check it several times a day

04:03.360 --> 04:04.480
as per your instructions.

04:05.280 --> 04:07.000
There's still no reply
from Her Highness.

04:08.920 --> 04:10.280
She must resent me.

04:11.440 --> 04:12.480
I'll go check again.

04:31.480 --> 04:32.120
Your Highness.

04:32.800 --> 04:33.840
Our informants report

04:34.160 --> 04:36.000
that Qi State's imperial exam
have concluded.

04:37.040 --> 04:38.880
(Cui Wei)
Mu Wuxia won Emperor Qi's favor

04:38.960 --> 04:40.400
(Head of Empress Lv's Shadow Guards)
and the scholars' support

04:40.480 --> 04:41.680
because of this.

04:42.440 --> 04:44.600
Noble clans of Qi are playing safe.

04:45.120 --> 04:46.200
None dare act recklessly.

04:47.200 --> 04:48.440
The entire Qi

04:48.880 --> 04:51.120
seems peaceful.

04:52.760 --> 04:54.760
This matter still vexes me.

04:55.960 --> 04:57.720
I devised such a brilliant plan,

04:58.480 --> 05:00.640
yet Mu Wuyin ruined it.

05:01.560 --> 05:03.320
He can't do anything right.

05:05.320 --> 05:07.880
Your Highness, Prince Wuyin
sent an urgent letter.

05:18.400 --> 05:20.760
(Shen Zaiye is investigating Hua)

05:23.760 --> 05:25.240
Shen Zaiye, you again.

05:28.640 --> 05:30.760
How dare you come after me?

05:33.120 --> 05:34.480
Looks like you have a death wish.

05:35.320 --> 05:35.920
Your Highness.

05:36.560 --> 05:37.360
All these years,

05:37.640 --> 05:39.160
we've tried to strike him.

05:39.640 --> 05:40.680
But even now,

05:40.760 --> 05:42.360
we still don't know
how many shadow guards

05:42.440 --> 05:43.360
he has around him.

05:44.520 --> 05:46.400
Trying to attack him
in Qi State's Yujing

05:47.200 --> 05:48.200
is far too difficult.

05:49.920 --> 05:51.520
If Yujing isn't ideal,

05:52.560 --> 05:53.520
lure everyone out.

05:54.680 --> 05:56.240
That eyesore, Jiang Taohua,

05:56.640 --> 05:58.920
is bound to interfere again.

06:00.600 --> 06:02.120
That Mu Wuxia

06:02.720 --> 06:04.520
also opposes me at every turn.

06:06.040 --> 06:07.520
I want them to know

06:09.040 --> 06:10.000
that whoever defies me

06:10.960 --> 06:12.080
will meet their doom.

06:13.360 --> 06:14.520
You're wise, Your Highness.

06:15.040 --> 06:17.760
But how do we get them to leave Yujing?

06:18.200 --> 06:20.320
Emperor Qi currently favors Mu Wuxia.

06:21.240 --> 06:22.640
From what I know of him,

06:23.040 --> 06:24.520
if he wants to make Mu Wuxia his heir,

06:24.600 --> 06:25.760
he'll pave the way for him.

06:26.560 --> 06:27.360
My spies

06:27.920 --> 06:29.520
near Qi State's border

06:30.200 --> 06:31.560
can now be put to use.

06:31.800 --> 06:33.120
Qi State's border?

06:34.120 --> 06:36.080
It's near Beiyuan's Luocheng.

06:36.200 --> 06:37.680
Luocheng is just lis away.

06:38.360 --> 06:39.600
Have them pose as bandits

06:40.600 --> 06:41.560
and stir up trouble.

06:43.520 --> 06:44.720
You're wise, Your Highness.

06:45.680 --> 06:46.800
How's Jiang Changjue?

06:48.400 --> 06:49.280
Over in Luocheng,

06:49.720 --> 06:51.320
Commandant Deng watches him closely.

06:51.720 --> 06:52.800
Nothing's gone wrong.

06:54.280 --> 06:56.120
Seems like our light restraints

06:56.240 --> 06:57.600
aren't causing enough misery.

06:58.920 --> 07:00.200
Time to go all out.

07:02.080 --> 07:05.800
(Luocheng,
Exile Region on Beiyuan's Border)

07:07.640 --> 07:08.440
Hurry.

07:09.800 --> 07:10.440
Hurry.

07:10.960 --> 07:11.560
Move!

07:13.680 --> 07:14.280
Hurry.

07:14.360 --> 07:15.720
(Jiang Changjue, Beiyuan Prince)

07:15.800 --> 07:17.040
(Jiang Changjue, Beiyuan Prince)
Hurry.

07:17.120 --> 07:17.880
Don't slack.

07:17.960 --> 07:18.560
Hurry.

07:30.240 --> 07:30.840
Hurry.

07:32.600 --> 07:33.200
Hurry.

07:33.640 --> 07:35.520
- Hurry.
- (Of the camps near Beiyuan's border,)

07:35.600 --> 07:37.160
(only Luocheng hasn't been searched.)

07:38.320 --> 07:40.960
(Prince Changjue might be here.)

07:42.280 --> 07:42.880
Hurry.

07:44.680 --> 07:46.200
Hurry up.

07:47.040 --> 07:47.640
Hurry up!

07:49.680 --> 07:52.400
Liu, you're slacking off again.

07:53.240 --> 07:53.840
Stop!

07:55.360 --> 07:55.960
Get lost!

07:57.640 --> 07:58.240
His Highness.

07:59.040 --> 07:59.840
Jiang Changjue,

08:00.120 --> 08:01.440
mind your own business.

08:03.200 --> 08:04.280
How dare you disobey me?

08:04.400 --> 08:06.080
I'll report this to Commandant Deng.

08:06.400 --> 08:07.360
Do as you wish.

08:07.440 --> 08:08.640
You… Just wait.

08:09.160 --> 08:10.200
Boys, watch Jiang Changjue.

08:10.280 --> 08:11.800
- Your Highness.
- Are you hurt?

08:14.600 --> 08:15.960
(Turns out His Highness)

08:16.160 --> 08:17.440
(can't come and go freely here.)

08:18.160 --> 08:19.000
Her Highness told me

08:19.240 --> 08:20.120
not to be impulsive.

08:20.400 --> 08:21.960
Censor Liu, let me help you to rest.

08:22.600 --> 08:23.200
Sure.

08:23.520 --> 08:24.120
Come on.

08:27.560 --> 08:29.920
(Seems I must follow
His Highness secretly.)

08:45.880 --> 08:46.480
Be careful.

08:46.960 --> 08:49.840
(Liu Jian'an, Beiyuan's Imperial Censor)

09:10.160 --> 09:10.960
Jiang Changjue.

09:11.800 --> 09:13.160
Commandant Deng summons you.

09:13.600 --> 09:14.200
Your Highness.

09:15.240 --> 09:17.000
Quit dawdling. Hurry.

09:17.640 --> 09:18.280
I'll be fine.

09:29.160 --> 09:30.840
Commandant Deng, Jiang Changjue is here.

09:31.160 --> 09:32.040
What are you doing?

09:32.560 --> 09:33.240
Let me go!

09:33.400 --> 09:34.200
Jiang Changjue,

09:34.760 --> 09:36.960
you're a real troublemaker in my camp.

09:37.960 --> 09:39.360
Why say that?

09:39.960 --> 09:42.120
I oversee a place of exile.

09:42.200 --> 09:43.920
(Deng Xiao,
Defending General of Luocheng)

09:44.000 --> 09:44.640
Not a charity.

09:45.680 --> 09:46.720
This place is full

09:46.800 --> 09:48.200
of vicious exiled criminals.

09:48.560 --> 09:49.320
But you?

09:49.400 --> 09:51.200
You're busy doing charity.

09:51.640 --> 09:53.440
You even helped
exiled ministers' children

09:53.640 --> 09:55.120
escape slavery.

09:56.320 --> 09:57.000
Do you admit

09:57.560 --> 09:58.440
all this?

09:59.040 --> 09:59.640
I do.

10:00.320 --> 10:01.160
But the ones I helped

10:01.240 --> 10:02.880
aren't vicious exiled criminals.

10:03.320 --> 10:04.280
Empress Lv framed them…

10:04.360 --> 10:04.960
Silence!

10:07.920 --> 10:09.240
Someone wants

10:10.760 --> 10:12.000
a piece of your flesh.

10:14.400 --> 10:15.520
I'm His Majesty's son.

10:16.360 --> 10:17.200
You wouldn't dare.

10:22.200 --> 10:24.240
I doubt His Majesty even remembers

10:24.560 --> 10:26.200
he has a son like you.

10:34.160 --> 10:35.400
You didn't even make a sound.

10:35.720 --> 10:36.920
You're a real man.

10:37.960 --> 10:38.960
Take him away.

10:39.160 --> 10:40.040
Guard him closely.

10:40.400 --> 10:41.200
Without my orders,

10:41.640 --> 10:42.520
no one

10:43.000 --> 10:43.960
is to release him.

10:44.200 --> 10:44.800
- Yes.
- Yes.

10:46.840 --> 10:48.680
Deng Xiao,
you're disloyal to the royal family!

10:48.760 --> 10:49.800
You side with Empress Lv.

10:50.240 --> 10:52.840
One day, you'll reap what you sow.

10:57.720 --> 10:58.520
(Do Good Deeds)

10:58.600 --> 10:59.280
Your Highness.

10:59.520 --> 11:00.600
Her Highness has replied.

11:13.880 --> 11:14.920
Summon Jiang Taohua.

11:15.080 --> 11:15.680
Yes.

11:39.440 --> 11:40.080
Your Highness.

11:41.160 --> 11:42.200
What do you need?

11:42.920 --> 11:44.200
I've just acquired something.

11:45.320 --> 11:46.360
Miss Meng,

11:47.160 --> 11:48.080
please take a look.

12:01.960 --> 12:02.800
Look closely.

12:03.880 --> 12:04.800
Miss Meng,

12:05.520 --> 12:07.360
this item looks familiar, right?

12:18.520 --> 12:19.240
Changjue.

12:19.320 --> 12:20.120
Watch the fire.

12:20.200 --> 12:21.240
Don't let it go out.

12:21.480 --> 12:22.840
I'll fetch more charcoal.

12:25.280 --> 12:26.560
Changjue, what's wrong?

12:27.640 --> 12:28.480
What happened?

12:28.600 --> 12:29.640
How did you get burned?

12:30.320 --> 12:31.960
I tried to guard the fire.

12:32.200 --> 12:34.400
I was afraid the wind would put it out.

12:36.680 --> 12:37.840
It's my fault.

12:38.040 --> 12:39.200
It's my fault.

12:45.480 --> 12:46.280
Changjue.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.280
What did you do to Changjue?

12:52.000 --> 12:53.000
Why so nervous?

12:53.760 --> 12:55.320
Jiang Changjue's still alive,

12:58.040 --> 12:59.520
but he doesn't have much time left.

13:01.120 --> 13:02.400
I just heard

13:03.320 --> 13:05.200
that he's
going to receive military punishment.

13:05.800 --> 13:07.000
Military punishment?

13:08.480 --> 13:09.080
That's right.

13:09.840 --> 13:11.400
He broke military rules in Beiyuan.

13:12.200 --> 13:13.920
He wished to see you before his death.

13:15.240 --> 13:17.280
Since you share
a deep bond with your brother,

13:18.520 --> 13:20.080
why don't I send you to meet him?

13:20.600 --> 13:21.760
Where is he?

13:22.640 --> 13:24.160
Luocheng, the place of exile.

13:26.280 --> 13:27.560
Why are you so kind?

13:27.640 --> 13:28.840
You don't have to trust me.

13:29.520 --> 13:31.040
You can wait and see.

13:31.640 --> 13:33.960
See if Jiang Changjue loses his head.

13:45.080 --> 13:45.680
Speaking of,

13:46.640 --> 13:47.640
it's dangerous

13:48.240 --> 13:49.840
for a lady like you to travel alone.

13:51.560 --> 13:54.080
How about asking
Shen Zaiye to go with you?

13:56.680 --> 13:57.480
Shen Zaiye?

13:58.920 --> 14:00.280
If Chancellor Shen goes with you,

14:00.720 --> 14:03.760
you won't die alone.

14:04.760 --> 14:06.560
(So they were targeting)

14:07.480 --> 14:09.160
(Shen Zaiye all along.)

14:09.600 --> 14:11.240
I've prepared a fast horse for you.

14:11.880 --> 14:12.920
The journey is far.

14:13.400 --> 14:14.680
If you keep delaying,

14:14.960 --> 14:16.160
your brother will be dead.

14:29.440 --> 14:30.040
Chancellor.

14:30.240 --> 14:31.480
Horses and supplies are ready.

14:31.800 --> 14:32.760
We're heading to Beiyuan

14:32.840 --> 14:33.960
with 30 shadow guards

14:34.120 --> 14:35.280
at your command.

14:37.800 --> 14:39.520
I'll go
to Prince Wuyin's residence first.

14:39.640 --> 14:40.960
Then, we'll depart immediately.

14:41.440 --> 14:42.040
Chancellor.

14:42.240 --> 14:43.520
Her Highness hurriedly rode out

14:43.600 --> 14:44.720
of Prince Wuyin's residence.

14:44.800 --> 14:46.000
She's heading to North Gate.

15:05.960 --> 15:08.240
(Why would Prince Wuyin let
Jiang Taohua leave?)

15:08.600 --> 15:09.880
(Something must've happened.)

15:24.440 --> 15:25.080
Jiang Taohua!

15:30.440 --> 15:31.680
(Shen Zaiye.)

15:45.440 --> 15:46.520
Why are you here?

15:47.480 --> 15:48.960
Have you had people watching me?

15:49.280 --> 15:50.200
Something happened?

15:51.880 --> 15:53.480
Prince Wuyin sent me on a mission.

15:54.040 --> 15:55.040
Where are you going?

15:56.640 --> 15:57.600
None of your concern.

15:58.280 --> 15:59.800
Please mind your own business.

16:01.320 --> 16:03.520
No matter how important or urgent
your affairs are,

16:03.600 --> 16:04.760
I will take care of them.

16:08.080 --> 16:09.440
If Chancellor Shen goes with you,

16:10.240 --> 16:12.440
you won't die alone.

16:13.760 --> 16:15.480
(Since they're after Shen Zaiye,)

16:15.560 --> 16:17.080
(things could take a different turn)

16:18.000 --> 16:19.600
(if he doesn't go.)

16:21.640 --> 16:22.320
Shen Zaiye.

16:23.520 --> 16:24.680
From the moment we met,

16:25.600 --> 16:27.000
I knew you were coldhearted.

16:28.080 --> 16:29.600
You tormented,

16:30.240 --> 16:30.840
humiliated,

16:31.360 --> 16:31.960
distressed,

16:32.400 --> 16:33.000
hunted

16:33.240 --> 16:34.040
and tortured me.

16:34.760 --> 16:36.640
There was never trust or affection
between us.

16:37.560 --> 16:39.560
I've always thought
this is the real you,

16:40.160 --> 16:41.840
yet you keep clinging to me.

16:42.800 --> 16:43.680
You keep pretending

16:43.840 --> 16:45.360
to seem affectionate.

16:45.600 --> 16:46.960
Don't you think it's ridiculous.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.720
You remember everything.

16:54.640 --> 16:56.920
The moment you saved me from that lake,

16:57.520 --> 16:58.800
I remembered everything.

17:02.680 --> 17:03.920
So you've been hiding

17:04.960 --> 17:06.079
the truth from the start.

17:08.400 --> 17:09.680
You and I are strangers now.

17:10.480 --> 17:11.480
There's nothing to hide.

17:12.280 --> 17:13.560
I simply don't want to explain.

17:16.000 --> 17:16.839
I don't believe you.

17:17.280 --> 17:18.960
What will it take for you to let me go?

17:19.720 --> 17:20.400
Jiang Taohua.

17:21.599 --> 17:22.800
We kept testing each other

17:22.880 --> 17:24.200
and guarding against one another

17:24.680 --> 17:25.800
that we ended up like this.

17:26.240 --> 17:26.880
Now,

17:28.079 --> 17:29.480
I want to hear your pain.

17:30.000 --> 17:31.320
I want to fight your battles.

17:32.600 --> 17:33.280
Do you trust me?

17:39.880 --> 17:40.560
Shen Zaiye,

17:42.080 --> 17:43.320
our fate has run its course.

17:44.000 --> 17:44.880
Why force it?

17:48.320 --> 17:49.880
I'm in a hurry. I must go.

17:50.600 --> 17:51.760
Is it Qingtai or Changjue?

17:53.560 --> 17:54.600
Changjue's in trouble?

17:55.240 --> 17:56.400
It's none of your concern.

17:57.880 --> 17:58.800
Beiyuan is far away.

17:59.480 --> 18:01.000
Did Mu Wuyin give you the antidote?

18:01.480 --> 18:02.080
He did.

18:02.480 --> 18:03.080
Impossible.

18:03.640 --> 18:04.280
Jiang Taohua.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.400
If I don't go with you,

18:06.680 --> 18:07.760
you can't save Changjue.

18:08.880 --> 18:10.000
If I can't save him,

18:10.920 --> 18:12.440
it's our fate then.

18:13.760 --> 18:15.680
I want nothing more to do with you.

18:15.880 --> 18:17.640
I don't want to owe you anything either.

18:20.400 --> 18:21.960
I've never met Changjue,

18:22.840 --> 18:24.400
but I've always considered him family.

18:26.640 --> 18:27.560
I, Shen Zaiye,

18:27.640 --> 18:29.000
am only a wandering lonely soul.

18:29.760 --> 18:31.480
I have few close relatives.

18:32.240 --> 18:33.320
If Changjue is in danger,

18:34.120 --> 18:35.040
how can I turn away?

18:35.120 --> 18:37.880
♪Become clear over time♪

18:37.960 --> 18:40.400
♪The long night passes in a flash♪

18:40.480 --> 18:42.320
We'll head toward
Beiyuan's Xingzhou first.

18:43.480 --> 18:44.800
Have Wu Jiang catch up to us.

18:45.880 --> 18:46.480
Yes.

18:48.240 --> 18:49.960
(How can I get rid of him?)

18:56.560 --> 18:57.200
Your Highness.

18:57.600 --> 18:58.600
Just as you predicted,

19:00.640 --> 19:01.840
they're headed to Beiyuan.

19:02.640 --> 19:03.440
Your Highness.

19:03.600 --> 19:04.800
What's our next move?

19:05.240 --> 19:07.360
Time to whisper in Father's ear

19:10.120 --> 19:11.520
and send Wuxia on his way.

19:12.240 --> 19:12.840
Yes.

19:22.560 --> 19:23.160
Father.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.560
I've brought your pills.

19:27.520 --> 19:28.680
Hand them over immediately.

19:32.920 --> 19:33.520
Hurry.

19:44.840 --> 19:45.640
Wuyin.

19:46.320 --> 19:49.160
This is really your forte.

19:50.040 --> 19:51.320
I lack the skill to rule.

19:51.400 --> 19:53.480
I only wish to seek
immortality and enlightenment.

19:54.240 --> 19:56.520
You're my son

19:57.080 --> 19:58.440
and a prince of Qi.

19:59.080 --> 20:00.880
How can you be so unambitious?

20:01.440 --> 20:02.280
You know me well.

20:02.800 --> 20:04.600
I've always been this way.

20:05.240 --> 20:06.640
Please don't be offended.

20:08.160 --> 20:08.760
Father.

20:09.240 --> 20:10.120
Don't worry.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.640
You still have Wuxia.

20:12.880 --> 20:15.320
Wuxia cares for the people
and is capable.

20:15.720 --> 20:17.200
Please train him well.

20:20.680 --> 20:21.720
Brotherly harmony

20:21.800 --> 20:23.320
is a blessing for the royal family.

20:23.880 --> 20:24.480
Very good.

20:25.920 --> 20:26.560
Father.

20:27.280 --> 20:28.440
I have one more thing

20:29.040 --> 20:30.120
to remind you.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.160
Go ahead.

20:33.320 --> 20:34.680
I overheard

20:35.520 --> 20:38.000
some noble families say
Wuxia is too gentle.

20:38.760 --> 20:39.840
They speak with disdain.

20:44.880 --> 20:46.360
Wuxia is a good scholar,

20:46.960 --> 20:49.600
but he does lack in combat skills.

20:53.560 --> 20:56.600
(Dingyuan Prefecture's Bandits)

21:01.520 --> 21:02.720
Summon Wuxia to the palace.

21:03.280 --> 21:04.080
Yes, Your Majesty.

21:08.520 --> 21:09.120
Father.

21:09.760 --> 21:10.920
Are you saying

21:11.000 --> 21:13.200
you want me to handle the bandit threat
at the border?

21:14.160 --> 21:14.880
Are you afraid?

21:15.800 --> 21:16.640
But I

21:16.920 --> 21:18.840
have only read military books.

21:19.520 --> 21:20.360
I worry

21:20.840 --> 21:21.640
that talking strategy

21:21.720 --> 21:22.800
will only make me a joke

21:23.240 --> 21:25.120
and humiliate you.

21:26.120 --> 21:27.280
Knowing strategy is enough.

21:28.160 --> 21:30.440
They're just bandits.

21:31.000 --> 21:31.920
What's there to fear?

21:33.080 --> 21:33.960
I've issued a decree.

21:34.680 --> 21:37.000
Commander Dong Lang at the border

21:37.600 --> 21:38.400
will assist you.

21:39.560 --> 21:41.440
He has fought countless battles

21:41.760 --> 21:43.440
and is experienced
in commanding an army.

21:43.960 --> 21:44.560
By then,

21:44.840 --> 21:46.320
learn all you can from him.

21:48.440 --> 21:49.040
Wuxia,

21:50.760 --> 21:52.080
you've picked many fine talents

21:52.720 --> 21:54.600
for me and Qi

21:54.880 --> 21:55.920
in this imperial exam.

21:56.000 --> 21:57.400
Your contribution is undeniable.

21:58.880 --> 22:01.120
I hope you keep working hard

22:01.760 --> 22:02.560
and not fail

22:02.640 --> 22:04.440
the effort I've invested
in nurturing you.

22:06.560 --> 22:07.200
When you

22:08.320 --> 22:09.480
return in triumph,

22:10.240 --> 22:10.840
I'll

22:11.400 --> 22:13.200
entrust you with greater duties.

22:18.000 --> 22:18.840
I accept.

22:19.960 --> 22:21.480
I won't fail you.

22:29.720 --> 22:30.520
Get prepared then.

22:31.560 --> 22:32.160
Yes.

22:33.200 --> 22:33.960
I will now leave.

22:44.040 --> 22:45.360
Letting Wuxia handle the bandits

22:45.920 --> 22:47.680
will help him earn military merit.

22:49.000 --> 22:49.840
Leave everything

22:50.440 --> 22:51.960
to Dong Lang.

22:53.040 --> 22:54.760
You think of everything.

22:56.000 --> 22:58.240
Deliver this secret letter to Dong Lang.

22:58.920 --> 22:59.920
Once he reads it,

23:00.280 --> 23:01.840
he'll understand my intentions.

23:02.160 --> 23:03.040
Yes, Your Majesty.

23:17.120 --> 23:17.760
Mu Wuxia.

23:22.200 --> 23:23.520
Why is a scholar like you

23:23.600 --> 23:24.480
holding a broadsword?

23:24.720 --> 23:26.360
Are you planning to be an executioner?

23:27.120 --> 23:27.720
What?

23:28.640 --> 23:29.720
Do you think

23:29.960 --> 23:31.120
this blade doesn't suit me?

23:33.600 --> 23:34.720
With your looks,

23:34.960 --> 23:35.920
a sword suits you best.

23:36.280 --> 23:36.880
See?

23:37.080 --> 23:38.120
I use a sword myself.

23:40.120 --> 23:41.440
Swords are weapons used on foot.

23:42.040 --> 23:43.080
On horseback,

23:43.480 --> 23:44.560
a blade works better.

23:45.760 --> 23:47.440
So you're riding and wielding a blade?

23:47.560 --> 23:48.560
Where are you going?

23:51.280 --> 23:53.480
Father sent me to the border
to fight bandits.

23:53.960 --> 23:55.960
Fight bandits?
Why didn't you say so earlier?

23:56.120 --> 23:57.560
How about I become your strategist

23:57.680 --> 23:58.480
and bodyguard?

23:58.560 --> 23:59.160
No.

23:59.600 --> 24:00.760
I'm going to fight bandits.

24:01.000 --> 24:02.120
How can I bring you along?

24:02.920 --> 24:04.240
You can go when you can't fight.

24:04.320 --> 24:05.320
Why can't I?

24:06.000 --> 24:07.480
No one can beat me.

24:08.800 --> 24:09.840
Except Zaiye,

24:10.400 --> 24:11.000
Zhanlu

24:11.280 --> 24:11.880
and Qingtai.

24:12.240 --> 24:13.440
So I'm the fourth best.

24:14.400 --> 24:15.400
No means no.

24:16.840 --> 24:18.840
Fighting bandits is no child's play.

24:19.560 --> 24:20.160
Besides,

24:20.320 --> 24:21.360
if anything happens to you,

24:21.440 --> 24:22.880
how do I explain to Chancellor Shen?

24:22.960 --> 24:24.200
How dare you say I'm playing?

24:24.400 --> 24:25.360
I'll kill you.

24:26.360 --> 24:27.480
Even if you kill me,

24:28.080 --> 24:29.040
I still can't take you.

24:42.240 --> 24:44.080
(Qi, Yujing)

25:06.800 --> 25:09.880
(Qi, Yujing)

25:28.120 --> 25:29.120
The fish are moving.

25:30.320 --> 25:31.520
That small Luocheng

25:33.400 --> 25:34.400
is about to get lively.

25:37.160 --> 25:37.800
Your Highness.

25:59.560 --> 26:03.360
(Beiyuan's Capital, Hao City)

26:05.040 --> 26:05.680
Your Highness.

26:06.560 --> 26:08.520
As you predicted,
Jiang Taohua and Shen Zaiye

26:08.600 --> 26:10.280
are on their way to save Jiang Changjue.

26:10.840 --> 26:11.520
Prince Wuyin

26:11.680 --> 26:13.200
had Mu Wuxia sent to the border too.

26:13.280 --> 26:15.360
We're just waiting
to wipe them all out in one go.

26:18.080 --> 26:18.680
Cui Wei.

26:19.840 --> 26:20.840
Take men to the border

26:21.000 --> 26:21.760
and stir up chaos.

26:22.280 --> 26:23.480
Lure Mu Wuxia into Luocheng.

26:24.120 --> 26:25.560
Luocheng's warden, Deng Xiao,

26:25.640 --> 26:27.040
was once His Majesty's confidant,

26:27.800 --> 26:29.440
but he's still not one of us.

26:30.080 --> 26:31.240
We mustn't trust him easily.

26:32.320 --> 26:33.840
You must handle it yourself.

26:34.480 --> 26:35.240
Understood.

26:35.520 --> 26:37.240
(Luocheng)

26:37.360 --> 26:37.960
Go.

26:38.800 --> 26:39.400
Go.

26:40.280 --> 26:40.880
Hurry!

26:41.200 --> 26:41.800
Keep up!

26:42.880 --> 26:44.160
Peasants captured at Qi's border

26:44.240 --> 26:44.840
are all here.

26:44.960 --> 26:45.880
Don't worry, General.

26:46.240 --> 26:47.600
Our men are disguised as bandits.

26:47.800 --> 26:49.440
No one knows we're Beiyuan soldiers.

26:59.640 --> 27:00.400
Good.

27:01.160 --> 27:02.840
We'll now wait for Mu Wuxia.

27:17.400 --> 27:19.440
(Inn at Qi's Border)

27:29.200 --> 27:29.800
Enter.

27:31.000 --> 27:32.720
Your Highness, a letter from the border.

27:39.000 --> 27:41.080
(Bandits have fled
toward Beiyuan's Luocheng.)

27:41.760 --> 27:43.320
(They must be caught before crossing)

27:43.400 --> 27:44.200
(Beiyuan's border.)

27:46.120 --> 27:46.720
Wang Xi.

27:46.800 --> 27:47.400
Yes.

27:47.720 --> 27:48.400
Alert everyone

27:48.680 --> 27:49.480
to depart at once.

27:49.720 --> 27:50.320
Yes.

27:52.040 --> 27:54.120
The bandits have fled toward Beiyuan.

27:54.680 --> 27:56.240
Wang Xi, pass the order.

27:56.600 --> 27:57.200
From today on,

27:57.280 --> 27:59.400
they can only rest
from the Hai hour to the Yin hour.

27:59.480 --> 28:00.400
We must intercept them

28:00.480 --> 28:01.400
within Qi territory.

28:01.480 --> 28:02.080
Yes.

28:03.000 --> 28:03.600
Let's go.

28:04.800 --> 28:05.440
Your Highness.

28:06.000 --> 28:06.680
Your Highness.

28:07.120 --> 28:07.960
One more person.

28:08.680 --> 28:09.280
Mu Wuxia.

28:21.080 --> 28:22.440
I already explained to you.

28:23.440 --> 28:24.800
Fighting bandits

28:25.000 --> 28:25.840
is no child's play.

28:26.000 --> 28:26.600
You…

28:29.600 --> 28:30.760
What if you get hurt?

28:31.720 --> 28:32.520
Mu Wuxia.

28:33.040 --> 28:34.680
Stop looking down on me.

28:35.280 --> 28:36.640
When I roamed the world,

28:36.720 --> 28:38.000
you were still wetting the bed.

28:38.880 --> 28:39.520
Miss Qingying.

28:40.480 --> 28:42.040
Mind your words.

28:45.640 --> 28:46.240
Wang Xi.

28:49.880 --> 28:50.600
No choice.

28:53.320 --> 28:54.120
Mu Wuxia.

28:54.960 --> 28:56.040
Don't be mad.

28:56.760 --> 28:57.960
I'll head back myself.

29:19.120 --> 29:19.760
Xiang Qingying.

29:24.240 --> 29:24.920
I command you

29:25.720 --> 29:26.920
to be my personal guard.

29:28.120 --> 29:30.160
Stay close and protect me.

29:32.560 --> 29:33.280
Will you?

29:37.240 --> 29:38.160
Yes.

29:45.880 --> 29:48.480
(Luocheng)

29:50.280 --> 29:51.040
Commandant Deng.

29:51.600 --> 29:53.280
You knew Her Highness

29:54.200 --> 29:56.240
kept Jiang Changjue
for greater purposes.

29:57.040 --> 29:58.680
How dare you
pretend to obey but defy her

29:58.880 --> 30:00.080
and let him escape?

30:01.840 --> 30:03.480
Do you think Hao City is too far

30:04.000 --> 30:05.920
for her power to reach here?

30:07.160 --> 30:08.200
But Her Highness

30:08.720 --> 30:10.560
isn't so easily deceived.

30:14.760 --> 30:15.640
Commandant Deng.

30:16.480 --> 30:17.720
A great storm is coming.

30:18.880 --> 30:20.240
Taking both sides

30:21.800 --> 30:23.480
will make you lose your footing.

30:27.640 --> 30:29.440
I dare not lie to you

30:29.800 --> 30:30.880
nor to Her Highness.

30:31.800 --> 30:33.200
I'll send my men to find him now.

30:33.400 --> 30:34.000
I'll bring

30:34.120 --> 30:36.280
Jiang Changjue to you within three days.

30:37.480 --> 30:38.200
Three days?

30:39.360 --> 30:40.720
If you fail to hand him over

30:40.880 --> 30:42.480
before nightfall today,

30:44.720 --> 30:46.120
you'll take on

30:47.440 --> 30:48.960
a different role here.

31:04.240 --> 31:05.960
Zhan Lu, you follow me all day.

31:06.040 --> 31:06.840
Can you stop already?

31:06.920 --> 31:09.320
I won't go easy on you
if you keep following me around.

31:09.800 --> 31:10.400
No.

31:10.480 --> 31:12.240
Do you think
I wanted to go through all this trouble

31:12.320 --> 31:13.040
just to find you?

31:13.120 --> 31:14.480
Just tell me where His Highness is.

31:14.560 --> 31:15.560
I'll leave immediately.

31:15.640 --> 31:16.920
I've told you countless times.

31:17.000 --> 31:18.240
His Highness is missing.

31:18.440 --> 31:20.160
Why won't you believe me?

31:20.800 --> 31:22.280
Because you lie all the time.

31:22.360 --> 31:24.960
How is saying I'm returning to Beiyuan
to find my family a lie?

31:25.160 --> 31:26.480
He's Her Highness's brother,

31:26.560 --> 31:27.760
so he's my family too.

31:29.560 --> 31:30.400
I don't believe it.

31:31.720 --> 31:32.760
Stop following me.

31:41.840 --> 31:43.280
Can you cut it out?

31:44.520 --> 31:46.000
Heaven help us!

31:46.080 --> 31:48.520
You're picking
on a helpless widow like me.

31:48.600 --> 31:50.320
What a bitter life.

31:50.720 --> 31:52.400
What do I do?

31:52.840 --> 31:55.520
This is top-grade leather.

31:55.920 --> 31:56.880
Madam, I'm so sorry.

31:58.200 --> 31:59.960
It's fine. I'll pay for the lambskin.

32:00.240 --> 32:00.840
Sorry.

32:01.120 --> 32:01.720
You'll pay?

32:02.000 --> 32:03.400
Alright, hand over the money.

32:04.240 --> 32:05.800
Why are you smiling? Pay up!

32:09.280 --> 32:09.880
Madam.

32:11.200 --> 32:13.640
Are you and your wife from the south?

32:14.360 --> 32:15.840
Buy her a few more.

32:16.200 --> 32:17.120
Otherwise, your wife

32:17.200 --> 32:18.880
can't handle Beiyuan's weather.

32:18.960 --> 32:20.640
Madam, we aren't…

32:21.280 --> 32:22.920
Miss, you must be newlyweds.

32:23.360 --> 32:24.800
When I just got married,

32:24.880 --> 32:26.040
I was even more shy than you.

32:26.120 --> 32:27.520
I didn't even dare enter the room.

32:27.600 --> 32:28.560
Zhanlu, don't run!

32:39.440 --> 32:40.840
Luocheng isn't far from here.

32:41.240 --> 32:41.840
Don't worry.

32:42.280 --> 32:43.360
Before we reach the city,

32:43.520 --> 32:44.600
Changjue will be safe.

33:04.920 --> 33:05.520
Here.

33:07.160 --> 33:07.760
Thank you.

33:16.080 --> 33:16.920
(He's done a lot)

33:17.840 --> 33:19.720
(to help and take care of me
on this journey.)

33:20.520 --> 33:21.520
(He's sincere.)

33:23.800 --> 33:24.960
(It's exactly why)

33:25.960 --> 33:27.960
(I can't let him risk himself for us.)

33:29.360 --> 33:31.040
(He should grow old peacefully)

33:32.320 --> 33:33.680
(in Yujing.)

33:46.640 --> 33:47.480
Rest here for a while.

33:47.560 --> 33:48.680
I'll gather some firewood.

34:34.480 --> 34:35.840
(She took all the horses.)

34:37.159 --> 34:38.840
(Is she that afraid I'll catch up?)

34:47.280 --> 34:49.600
(Luocheng)

35:15.240 --> 35:17.120
Commandant, Princess Chengping is here.

35:17.720 --> 35:18.320
The princess?

35:20.400 --> 35:22.880
Rumor said she died
falling from a cliff in Qi.

35:23.920 --> 35:24.680
Are you sure?

35:24.760 --> 35:26.560
The gate guard
served at the palace before.

35:28.880 --> 35:29.920
Her presence here

35:30.120 --> 35:31.800
must be related to Jiang Changjue.

35:32.760 --> 35:33.640
Follow Her Highness.

35:34.200 --> 35:35.320
If Jiang Changjue appears,

35:35.600 --> 35:36.440
report immediately.

35:36.520 --> 35:37.120
Yes.

35:47.080 --> 35:48.280
(Good timing.)

35:48.720 --> 35:50.160
(I can wipe them out in one sweep.)

35:50.840 --> 35:51.560
(You're not)

35:52.280 --> 35:53.400
(going back alive.)

36:12.400 --> 36:15.600
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

36:15.680 --> 36:18.720
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

36:19.640 --> 36:22.760
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

36:22.880 --> 36:26.640
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

36:26.920 --> 36:30.000
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

36:30.120 --> 36:33.440
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

36:33.840 --> 36:37.400
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

36:37.480 --> 36:43.200
♪With no one it can be brought♪

36:48.160 --> 36:55.080
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

36:55.520 --> 37:02.360
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

37:02.840 --> 37:09.840
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

37:10.160 --> 37:14.200
♪Even if it means this flower♪

37:14.320 --> 37:21.280
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

37:32.400 --> 37:35.520
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

37:35.600 --> 37:38.840
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

37:39.200 --> 37:42.880
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

37:43.000 --> 37:49.560
♪No longer needing to say♪

37:53.640 --> 38:00.560
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

38:00.960 --> 38:07.920
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

38:08.280 --> 38:15.280
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

38:15.640 --> 38:17.320
♪And finding♪

38:17.400 --> 38:24.400
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
